<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Tigrinya, a draft not yet read by a fluent reviewer (#495). The notes on each string are in values/strings.xml.
    Ethiopic script in Eritrean spelling (ጸ, not ፀ), with the polite plural address (ንስኹም) throughout.
    "Vehicle" is መኪና (plural መካይን, agreeing as feminine), the everyday word for any motor vehicle; "route" is
    መስመር; "run" is ዙር; "trip" is ጉዕዞ; "stop" is መዕረፊ; "report" is ጸብጻብ (plural ጸብጻባት); "block" is ብሎክ;
    "agency" is ትካል; "dispatcher" is ተቖጻጻሪ; "sign in" is ምእታው and "sign out" is ምውጻእ; "timetable" and
    "schedule" are both መደብ ግዜ; "location" is ቦታ; "diagnostics" is ሓበሬታ ኣፕ; minutes are ደቒቕ and hours ሰዓት.
-->
